engines of three cars and turn the engines at different speeds to see how fast they go.\n9. Build a Ferris wheel with the Ferris wheel parts.", "short_description": "Design and build your own virtual amusement park. This creative experiment combines engineering, physics, and imagination to bring your dream park to life."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "25921000940897789"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974579_694973826154079_7578271127767692502_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OAmTCkdGzLUQ7kNvwE51QVH&_nc_oc=AdkpRWj-7AjYCvkpGDd8r4YczG6r5C3dbDH7gnz6y_Mw3CzfFL5msSMESXaOoDXty7M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwlCpnHkxFAS-S52xiMdx5SbYOVePL8zSCNpNwUUt5TeA&oe=69B15A80"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Creating Amusement Park - ContentsDa Science Experiment", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "APPS", "id": "3626